  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="b09a57e1-ca1c-588b-af45-27e9afb8295d" activityNameId="dac2bfca-588a-5331-900b-79d265723659" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, freight train, diesel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, freight train, diesel
The data represents a diesel goods train with a weight of 1000 Gt. Variation in the geography of different countries have been taken into account by classifying 15 European countries  into 3 regions (flat, hilly, mountain).;
UUID: 541b1d6f-1e3c-36cf-aa71-57bb8744d908
The inventory includes the diesel consumption and diesel engine emissions  for an average European diesel traction goods train (1000 Gt)  In addition  diesel consumption and emissions of shunting processes are accounted for.
Location: Data refers to average goods transport conditions in Europe (EU 15)
Technology: diesel traction
Time period: Data for the determination of European average is based on statistical data from 1998
Production volume: 134837 Mio tkm
Sampling: European Rail statistic &amp; literature studies 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_541b1d6f-1e3c-36cf-aa71-57bb8744d908.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
